1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,436
Lead Trace connects lead discovery, a built-in CRM, and
evidence-backed sales research in one workspace.

2
00:00:06,836 --> 00:00:09,575
We listened to feedback from industry professionals.

3
00:00:09,575 --> 00:00:14,663
InsightIQ is now Lead Trace, expanded around the daily work of
sales teams.

4
00:00:15,063 --> 00:00:17,173
Start with your buyer profile.

5
00:00:17,173 --> 00:00:22,658
Search companies and people, then inspect the evidence for
industry, role, and location.

6
00:00:23,058 --> 00:00:28,971
Deep discovery combines web search, full-page reading, company-
site crawls, and public registries.

7
00:00:28,971 --> 00:00:32,419
A source-supported match still needs human review.

8
00:00:32,819 --> 00:00:35,623
Qualify a prospect before saving it to CRM.

9
00:00:35,623 --> 00:00:38,076
Source quotes stay attached to the contact.

10
00:00:38,476 --> 00:00:42,182
Keep ownership, notes, opportunities, and research together.

11
00:00:42,182 --> 00:00:45,359
Each contact highlights the next follow-up.

12
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:49,178
Use Board or Table view to track deals.

13
00:00:49,178 --> 00:00:53,878
Filter follow-ups by overdue, today, or upcoming, and reopen
completed actions.

14
00:00:54,278 --> 00:00:59,847
Prepare for a meeting or draft outreach using your prospect and
offer context.

15
00:00:59,847 --> 00:01:03,274
Inspect source claims, hypotheses, and questions before use.

16
00:01:03,674 --> 00:01:06,466
Discovery and research run in the background.

17
00:01:06,466 --> 00:01:12,051
The API and Python worker use stored evidence, with Qwen
supporting qualification and briefing.

18
00:01:12,451 --> 00:01:17,060
Connect your own Google Calendar to create a meeting from a
contact.

19
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:18,213
Invitations are optional.

20
00:01:18,213 --> 00:01:21,286
Two-way Calendar sync and email integration remain planned.

21
00:01:21,686 --> 00:01:27,554
A recorded live audit found nine prospects, with one supported
by all requested criteria.

22
00:01:27,554 --> 00:01:29,231
The CRM-to-research journey completed.

23
00:01:29,231 --> 00:01:32,584
This small cohort is not a coverage benchmark.

24
00:01:32,984 --> 00:01:35,766
These product screens contain fictional sample data.

25
00:01:35,766 --> 00:01:36,561
Lead Trace.

26
00:01:36,561 --> 00:01:40,933
Find the lead, know the context, and track the next step.

27
00:01:40,933 --> 00:01:42,921
Visit lead trace dot online.
